      "description": "Created a premium social media campaign for Elafine, a product visualization and motion design service. The project positions high-end product demos as a stronger alternative to basic screen recordings, using clear before-and-after storytelling, polished interface mockups, bold typography, and a refined lavender-and-white visual system. I designed promotional creatives that communicate the value of premium presentation, flexible packages, and fast turnaround while keeping the message clean, modern, and conversion-focused.\n"
