      "description": "Designed a conversion-focused social media campaign for Trendtrack, an e-commerce intelligence platform. I transformed its analytics dashboard, customer insights, and growth data into bold promotional creatives for Instagram and digital marketing. The visual system combines a dark interface, neon green accents, clear typography, product mockups, testimonials, and strong CTAs to communicate credibility and drive discovery. Delivered polished, platform-ready visuals that position Trendtrack as a trusted tool for e-commerce professionals.\n"
